{"Cost":5000,"Address":"3204 GREENMOUNT AVE","prc_lot":"002 ","BLOCKLOT":"3882 002","OBJECTID":3148,"CaseNumber":"BCCM-26-000528","IssuedDate":1776124800000,"PermitName":"3204 Greenmount","Description":"Replace (3) 100-amp, three-phase electrical service and service panel for the building. Work includes coordination with BGE for utility service modifications, installation of new service conductors, service disconnecting means, panelboard, grounding electrode system, bonding, labeling, and all required terminations. Provide new feeders to associated mechanical equipment including interior air handler and rooftop condenser, and install required rooftop disconnect. Remove existing non-compliant service equipment as required. All work to be performed in accordance with NEC, Baltimore City Electrical Code, and BGE utility requirements.

Approved For Work only. Subject to the permitted uses and regulations under the provisions of the Zoning Ordinance.

